# The skill and its cases are the shared artefact; what runs them is not.
#
# promptlab.py is a local copy of the `optimization-engines` plugin's runner
# (skills/prompt-engineer/scripts/promptlab.py) with three fixes applied on 2026-09-22: a
# `--timeout` flag, UTF-8 on the subprocess stdin (this skill's `>=` and arrows crashed it under
# cp1252) and a checkpoint write after each case. It belongs to that plugin, not to Tendril, and
# re-copying it is one command — so it is not vendored here.
#
# prompts.json is generated from SKILL.md, and results.json is one run's output.
promptlab.py
prompts.json
results.json
